{"id": "22-4414-2-7", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾中：ruhi、āruhi、oruhi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4415-2-13", "zh": "依规则‘Kusaruhissa cchī’：abhirucchi，或作 abhiruhi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4416-2-8", "zh": "Labha（意为获得）：labhati、labhanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4417-2-18", "zh": "ya 作前形同化后，依规则‘catutthadutiyesvesaṃ tatiyapaṭhamā’，复辅音首的第四音变为第三音：labbhati、labbhanti、labbhare。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4418-2-5", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾中：alabhi、alabhiṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4419-2-22", "zh": "651. Labhā iṃīnaṃ thaṃthā vā（labha 之后的 iṃ、ī 可变为 thaṃ、thā）[ka.497; rū.477; nī.1013]。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4420-2-20", "zh": "在 labha 之后的 iṃ、ī 依次可变为 thaṃ、thā，词根末音作后形同化，复辅音首的第二音变为第一音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4421-2-13", "zh": "ahaṃ alatthaṃ，或作 alabhiṃ（我得到了）；so alattha，或作 alabhi（他得到了）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4422-2-74", "zh": "依大规则，uṃ 变为 thuṃ、thaṃsu，mhā 变为 thamhā、thuṃmhā：te bhagavato santike pabbajjañca upasampadañca alatthuṃ（他们在世尊座下得到了出家与受具足戒）[dī.ni.2.77]；satiṃ paccalatthuṃ（他们恢复了正念）；viparītasaññaṃ paccalatthuṃ（他们又生起了颠倒想）；te satiṃ paccalatthaṃsu（他们恢复了正念）；agamamhā kho tava gehaṃ, tattha neva dānaṃ alatthamhā（我们去过你家，在那里一点布施也没有得到）[ma.ni.2.300（稍有出入）]；akkosameva alatthamhā（我们得到的只有辱骂）；mayañca alatthamhā savanāya（我们也得到了听闻的机会）；或作 alatthumhā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4422-75-78", "zh": "词根末音也可变为 ccha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4422-79-94", "zh": "Tadāhaṃ pāpikaṃ diṭṭhiṃ, paṭilacchiṃ ayoniso（那时我不如理地接受了邪恶的见解）[jā.1.16.204]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4423-2-41", "zh": "在 ssati 等语尾中，依规则‘labhavasa chida gama bhida rudānaṃ cchaṅa’，词根末音连同 ssa 替换为 ccha：lacchati、labhissati，lacchanti、labhissanti，lacchasi、labhissasi，lacchatha、labhissatha，lacchāmi、labhissāmi，lacchāma、labhissāma。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4423-42-58", "zh": "Lacchāma putte jīvantā, arogā ca bhavāmase（只要我们活着，就会重新得到儿子们，愿我们健康无病）[jā.2.22.2260]。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4424-2-9", "zh": "在 ssā 等语尾中：alacchā、alabhissā，alacchaṃsu、alabhissaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4425-2-8", "zh": "Vaca（意为清晰地说话）：vacati、vacanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4426-2-5", "zh": "被动：vacīyati、vacīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4427-2-25", "zh": "ya 作前形同化后，依规则‘assū’，词首的 a 变为 u：vuccati、vuccanti、vuccare、vuccate、vuccante、vuccare。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4428-2-17", "zh": "使役：vāceti、vācenti、vācayati、vācayanti、vācāpeti、vācāpenti、vācāpayati、vācāpayanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4429-2-5", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾中：avaci、vaci。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4430-2-34", "zh": "依大规则，加 ā 并增 s 音：avacāsi、vacāsi，avacuṃ、vacuṃ，avaciṃsu、vaciṃsu；tvaṃ avaco、avaca、avaci、avacāsi、avacittha、avacittho；tumhe avacittha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4431-2-41", "zh": "依规则‘Mhāthānamuña’：tumhe avacuttha、vacuttha；ahaṃ avaciṃ、vaciṃ、avacāsiṃ、vacāsiṃ；mayaṃ avacimhā、vacimhā，或作 avacimha、vacimha；mayaṃ avacumhā、vacumhā；so avacā、vacā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4432-2-21", "zh": "元音缩短时：avaca，avacittha 或 vacittha；ahaṃ avacaṃ，avaca 或 vaca；mayaṃ avacimhe、vacimhe。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4433-2-36", "zh": "652. Īādo vacassoma（在 ī 等语尾中，vaca 的 a 变为 o）[ka.477; rū.479; nī.958; caṃ.6.2.69; pā.7.4.20]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4434-2-7", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾中，vaca 的元音变为以 m 为附标的 o。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4435-2-34", "zh": "so avoci，te avocuṃ、avociṃsu，tvaṃ avoci，tumhe avocuttha，ahaṃ avociṃ，mayaṃ avocumhā；so avoca，这是短音形式，如 bhagavā etadavoca（世尊说了这番话）[udā.20]。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4436-2-3", "zh": "在 ssati 等语尾中——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4437-2-30", "zh": "653. Vacabhujamucavisānaṃ kkhaṅa（vaca、bhuja、muca、visa 的末音连同 ssa 变为 kkha）[ka.481; rū.524; nī.963；多本作‘bhuja muca vaca visānaṃ kkhaṅa’]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4438-2-12", "zh": "在带 ssa 的语尾中，vaca 等词根的末辅音连同 ssa 可变为 kkha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4439-2-40", "zh": "vakkhati、vacissati，vakkhanti、vakkhare、vacissanti、vacissare，vakkhasi，vakkhatha，vakkhāmi，vakkhāma，vakkhate，vakkhante，vakkhase，vakkhavhe；ahaṃ vakkhaṃ、vacissaṃ，mayaṃ vakkhāmhe、vacissāmhe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4440-2-15", "zh": "即使不承接‘Ssenā’（连同 ssa）这一管辖，词根末音也可以替换为 kkha：vakkhissati、vakkhissanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4441-2-9", "zh": "在 ssā 等语尾中：avakkhā、avacissā，avakkhaṃsu、avacissaṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4442-2-20", "zh": "Vada（意为清晰地说话）：vadati、vadanti，ovadati、ovadanti，vadasi，vadatha，vadāmi，vadāma。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4443-2-14", "zh": "la 变为 e 时：vadeti、vadenti、vadesi、vadetha、vademi、vadema。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4444-2-9", "zh": "被动：vadīyati、vadiyyati，ovadīyati、ovadiyyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4445-2-14", "zh": "d 变为腭音组、ya 作前形同化后：vajjati、vajjanti，ovajjati、ovajjanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4446-2-23", "zh": "使役：bheriṃ vādeti（击鼓）、vādenti、vādayati、vādayanti；guruṃ abhivādeti（向师长致敬）、abhivādenti、abhivādesi、abhivādetha、abhivādemi、abhivādema。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4447-2-19", "zh": "依大规则，a 变为 i：abhivādiyāmi、abhivādiyāma，或作 abhivādayāmi、abhivādayāma，意思是‘我礼敬’‘我们礼敬’。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4447-20-36", "zh": "因为礼敬的人就是让对方说出“愿你安乐”这句祝福语，而说出这样的话也是受礼者的本分。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4448-2-9", "zh": "加 ṇāpi 时不作元音增强：vadāpeti、vadāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4449-2-20", "zh": "依规则‘Gamavadadānaṃ ghammavajjadajjā vā’替换为 vajja，依规则‘ūlasse’ la 变为 e：vajjeti、vajjenti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4450-2-5", "zh": "被动：vajjīyati、vajjīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4451-2-5", "zh": "使役：vajjāpeti、vajjāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4452-2-23", "zh": "在 eyya 等语尾中，依规则‘eyyeyyāseyyaṃnaṃṭe’，eyya 等单数语尾变为 e：vade、vadeyya，vajje、vajjeyya，vadeyyuṃ、vajjeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4453-2-16", "zh": "替换为 vajja 时，依大规则 eyya 变为 ā，eyyuṃ 等语尾中的 eyya 脱落：so vajjā，te vajjuṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4454-2-34", "zh": "eyya 等语尾中的 yyā 可以脱落：tvaṃ vajjāsi、vajjesi，tumhe vajjātha、vajjetha，ahaṃ vajjāmi、vajjemi，mayaṃ vajjāma、vajjema；ahaṃ vajjaṃ，mayaṃ vajjāmhe、vajjeyyāmhe。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4455-2-59", "zh": "这里有圣典文句：vajjuṃ vā te na vā vajjuṃ, natthi nāsāya rūhanā（不管他们说还是不说，鼻子都不会再长出来）[jā.1.3.33]；ammaṃ ārogyaṃ vajjāsi, tvañca tāta sukhī bhava（请代我向母亲问安，孩子，愿你也安乐）[jā.2.22.2148]；ammaṃ ārogyaṃ vajjātha, ayaṃ no neti brāhmaṇo（请代我们向母亲问安，这个婆罗门要把我们带走了）[jā.2.22.2174]，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4456-2-19", "zh": "昨天过去时：so avadā、vadā、avajjā、vajjā，te avadū、vadū、avajjū、vajjū。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4457-2-27", "zh": "今天过去时：so avadi、vadi、avajji、vajji，te avaduṃ、vaduṃ、avajjuṃ、vajjuṃ、avadiṃsu、vadiṃsu、avajjiṃsu、vajjiṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4458-2-5", "zh": "在 ssati 等语尾中：vadissati、vajjissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4459-2-6", "zh": "在 ssā 等语尾中：avadissā、avajjissā，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4460-2-5", "zh": "Vida（意为知）：vidati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4461-2-12", "zh": "依规则‘Yuvaṇṇānamiyaṅauvaṅa sare’，在元音前替换为 iya：te vidiyanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4462-2-25", "zh": "使役：nivedeti、paṭivedeti、nivedayati、paṭivedayati；paṭivedayāmi vo bhikkhave（比丘们，我告诉你们）[ma.ni.1.416]，意思是‘我使你们知道’。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4462-26-46", "zh": "Vedayāmahaṃ bhante, vedayatīti maṃ saṅgho dhāretū（尊者，我在告知，请僧团记住我在告知）[cūḷava.aṭṭha.102]，意思是‘我使人知道’，或‘我公开’。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4463-2-29", "zh": "也有读作“Vediyāmahaṃ bhante, vediyatīti maṃ saṅgho dhāretū”的 [cūḷava.aṭṭha.102]；在这种读法里，后接 a 语缀时替换为 iya 是合理的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4464-2-9", "zh": "在 eyya 等语尾中：videyya、vidiyeyya，videyyuṃ、vidiyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4465-2-10", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾中：paccayānaṃ khayaṃ avedi（他了知了诸缘的灭尽），te viduṃ、vidiṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
